                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Nice quaint restaurant focused on southeast Asian cuisine. Where I liked is the seafood laksa and bbq chicken. The laksa is pretty close to authentic taste although more on the sour side. The bbq chicken though small, packs a punch in terms of taste and succulent. The curry noodle is average. Where I like is they give a huge drumstick. The table is a little small for 2 persons but the staff are friendly. Overall nice place. I will be very focused on certain food when I visit.",
